      "description": "A hideous creature that resembles a woman with countless snakes for hair. Its accursed gaze can turn a man to stone, while its claws and voice are just as deadly in their own ways. Occasionally called a “Marid” for some reason, but it's not terribly clear what one of those would even be. - Imban"
